53
00:03:58.385 --> 00:04:03.652
At most, this visual explains the chapter's design rationale at argument

54
00:04:03.652 --> 00:04:08.440
support; it adds no empirical, deployment, safety, transfer, state-of-the-art, AGI,

55
00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:13.229
or ASI result. The next chapter is Privacy, Data Rights,

56
00:04:13.229 --> 00:04:14.665
and Information-Flow Governance.

57
00:04:15.005 --> 00:04:20.679
It takes responsibility for A system can preserve confidentiality and pass

58
00:04:20.679 --> 00:04:26.352
access checks while authorized collection, linkage, inference, memory, training, sharing, retention,

59
00:04:26.352 --> 00:04:31.510
